WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.958
Zacapa plot. A computer voice is reading this.

2
00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:16.691
In April, your land is usually left with no plants covering it; in January, February, March and May, with little cover. The satellite saw it from 2021 to 2025.

3
00:00:16.941 --> 00:00:22.380
In the last 15 years, the satellite saw no fires within half a kilometer of your plot.

4
00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:29.227
In 3 of the last 25 years, the midsummer drought brought more than 15 days in a row with almost no rain.

5
00:00:29.477 --> 00:00:42.750
This year, July and August got only a fifth of the normal rain (21 %). That is less than in 2018, the driest year since 1991. It is a preliminary figure.

6
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.738
We can't say which option is best: two rain sources disagree.

7
00:00:46.988 --> 00:00:50.861
This is not an official notice: talk it over with your extension worker.
